  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the leadership and capacity of civil society organisations in Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen the organizational and technical capacities of Malian Civil Society Organisations (CSOs), to become an effective and recognized partners in terms of advocacy and influence in the field of good governance and hygiene, sanitation so that they can contribute to the development in the country. The action specifically seeks to (1) Strengthen the intervention capacities of civil society organizations working; (2) Improve the governance of civil society organizations and facilitate their networking empower as citizens in order to promote social change; and (3) Strengthen accountable local governance.</narrative>
  </description>
